WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You saw that claim five times.
Did you see five sources?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A repeat can feel familiar
without becoming more accurate.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The illusory truth effect:
repeated claims can seem truer.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Look for the original experiment—
not five reposts.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try the free twelve-minute
Focus Fieldbook first.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Ask for exact evidence and terms.
Seller claims are not trials.
